  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On the Heavenly Court battlefield, Seven Extreme Desolation spat countless pitch-black needles at him while he was still using chaotic dragon fist against Calamity Luck Altar. He felt a chilling pain before the needles touched him, then activated this move. He immediately saw through many details of the needles: the move contained the essence of dark path and was used to counter defensive methods. Dragon scales or nine dragons protection alone would have left countless holes in his body and heavily injured him. He answered with offense against offense, breathing out qi current scissors.",
